---
import SiteLayout from "../layouts/SiteLayout.astro";
import Header from "../components/Header.astro";
import Footer from "../components/Footer.astro";
---
<SiteLayout title="saGraph — a task manager for dependencies" description="A desktop task manager for work where one task depends on another. See what is ready, what is blocked, and why.">
  <Header />
  <main>
    <section class="hero container">
      <div class="hero-copy">
        <p class="eyebrow">A task manager for dependent work</p>
        <h1>Know what you can <span>do <b>next.</b></span></h1>
        <p class="hero-lead">saGraph turns task dependencies into a clear next step. See what is ready, what is blocked, and the exact reason why.</p>
        <div class="actions"><a class="button button-primary" href="/download">Download saGraph <span>↓</span></a><a class="button button-ghost" href="#how-it-works">See how it works <span>↓</span></a></div>
        <div class="hero-meta"><span>Windows · Linux · macOS</span><span>Local-first data</span><span>No account required</span></div>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-product">
        <div class="window-card" aria-label="saGraph interface preview">
          <div class="window-top"><span class="dots"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><span>saGraph</span><span>⋯</span></div>
          <div class="window-body"><div class="mini-title">Today <span>4 tasks</span></div><div class="task done"><b>✓</b><span>Review project brief</span></div><div class="task ready"><b>→</b><span>Write implementation plan</span><em>Ready</em></div><div class="task blocked"><b>⊘</b><span>Ship first prototype</span><em>2 blockers</em></div><div class="task ready"><b>→</b><span>Send progress update</span><em>Ready</em></div></div>
        </div>
        <div class="product-note"><span class="status-dot"></span><div><strong>Implementation is ready</strong><small>Its prerequisites are complete.</small></div></div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="problem-section container" id="how-it-works">
      <div class="section-heading"><p class="eyebrow">The problem</p><h2>Your tasks have <span class="accent-text">dependencies.</span><br /><span class="nowrap">Your Todo app probably <span class="accent-text">does not.</span></span></h2><p class="section-intro">But “Implement Login” cannot start until “Design Login UI” and “API Specification” are done. A priority list can show the tasks; it cannot show the condition.</p></div>
      <div class="dependency-story card">
        <div class="story-prerequisites">
          <div class="story-prereq-row"><div class="story-task done"><div class="story-task-main"><span>✓</span><strong>Design Login UI</strong></div><small>Completed</small></div><span class="story-prereq-line"></span></div>
          <div class="story-prereq-row"><div class="story-task done"><div class="story-task-main"><span>✓</span><strong>API Specification</strong></div><small>Completed</small></div><span class="story-prereq-line"></span></div>
        </div>
        <div class="story-connector"></div>
        <div class="story-join">Both prerequisites are complete</div>
        <div class="story-connector output-connector"></div>
        <div class="story-task ready"><div class="story-task-main"><span>→</span><strong>Implement Login</strong></div><small>Ready to start</small></div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="workflow-section container">
      <div class="workflow-copy"><p class="eyebrow">A real project example</p><h2>Follow the work from research to release.</h2><p>A software project is rarely a pile of independent tasks. saGraph makes the chain visible so the next action is based on what is actually unblocked—not just what looks important.</p><a class="text-link" href="/docs">Read the dependency docs <span>→</span></a></div>
      <div class="case-study card" aria-label="Software project dependency chain"><div class="case-label">Software project</div><div class="case-step complete"><span class="case-icon">✓</span><div><strong>Research</strong><small>Done</small></div></div><div class="case-line"></div><div class="case-step complete"><span class="case-icon">✓</span><div><strong>Architecture</strong><small>Done</small></div></div><div class="case-line"></div><div class="case-step ready"><span class="case-icon">→</span><div><strong>Implementation</strong><small>Ready now</small></div></div><div class="case-line"></div><div class="case-step waiting"><span class="case-icon">○</span><div><strong>Testing</strong><small>Waiting for implementation</small></div></div><div class="case-line"></div><div class="case-step waiting"><span class="case-icon">○</span><div><strong>Release</strong><small>Waiting for testing</small></div></div></div>
    </section>

    <section class="logic-section container">
      <div class="section-heading"><p class="eyebrow">More than a linear checklist</p><h2>Dependencies are not always <span class="nowrap">one-to-one.</span></h2><p class="section-intro">Describe the condition that really matters. saGraph supports AND, OR, and NOT relationships instead of forcing every workflow into a single line.</p></div>
      <div class="logic-grid">
        <article class="card logic-card"><div class="logic-title"><span class="logic-symbol and-symbol">AND</span><span>Both required</span></div><svg class="logic-svg" viewBox="0 0 250 110" role="img" aria-label="AND dependency: A and B unlock C"><defs><marker id="arrow-and" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" refX="6" refY="3.5" orient="auto"><path d="M0 0L7 3.5L0 7Z" fill="var(--accent)" /></marker></defs><rect class="svg-task" x="8" y="8" width="44" height="30" rx="7" /><text class="svg-task-label" x="30" y="28">A</text><rect class="svg-task" x="8" y="72" width="44" height="30" rx="7" /><text class="svg-task-label" x="30" y="92">B</text><path class="svg-edge and-edge" d="M52 23H76V55H88" /><path class="svg-edge and-edge" d="M52 87H76V55H88" /><rect class="svg-gate gate-and" x="88" y="44" width="44" height="22" rx="5" /><text class="svg-gate-label" x="110" y="59">AND</text><path class="svg-edge and-edge" marker-end="url(#arrow-and)" d="M132 55H174" /><rect class="svg-output" x="178" y="40" width="44" height="30" rx="7" /><text class="svg-output-label" x="200" y="60">C</text></svg><p><b>C</b> becomes ready only when A and B are complete.</p></article>
        <article class="card logic-card"><div class="logic-title"><span class="logic-symbol or-symbol">OR</span><span>Either path works</span></div><svg class="logic-svg" viewBox="0 0 250 110" role="img" aria-label="OR dependency: A or B unlocks C"><defs><marker id="arrow-or" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" refX="6" refY="3.5" orient="auto"><path d="M0 0L7 3.5L0 7Z" fill="var(--muted)" /></marker></defs><rect class="svg-task" x="8" y="8" width="44" height="30" rx="7" /><text class="svg-task-label" x="30" y="28">A</text><rect class="svg-task" x="8" y="72" width="44" height="30" rx="7" /><text class="svg-task-label" x="30" y="92">B</text><path class="svg-edge or-edge" d="M52 23H76V55H92" /><path class="svg-edge or-edge" d="M52 87H76V55H92" /><ellipse class="svg-gate gate-or" cx="110" cy="55" rx="18" ry="11" /><text class="svg-gate-label" x="110" y="59">OR</text><path class="svg-edge or-edge" marker-end="url(#arrow-or)" d="M128 55H174" /><rect class="svg-output" x="178" y="40" width="44" height="30" rx="7" /><text class="svg-output-label" x="200" y="60">C</text></svg><p><b>C</b> becomes ready when either A or B is complete.</p></article>
        <article class="card logic-card"><div class="logic-title"><span class="logic-symbol not-symbol">NOT</span><span>Block on a condition</span></div><svg class="logic-svg not-svg" viewBox="0 0 250 110" role="img" aria-label="NOT dependency: A blocks C"><defs><marker id="tee-not" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" refX="6" refY="3.5" orient="auto"><path d="M6 0V7" stroke="#ef4444" stroke-width="2" /></marker></defs><rect class="svg-task danger-task" x="18" y="40" width="44" height="30" rx="7" /><text class="svg-task-label" x="40" y="60">A</text><path class="svg-edge not-edge" marker-end="url(#tee-not)" d="M62 55H92" /><ellipse class="svg-gate gate-not" cx="110" cy="55" rx="18" ry="11" /><text class="svg-gate-label not-label" x="110" y="59">NOT</text><path class="svg-edge not-edge" marker-end="url(#tee-not)" d="M128 55H174" /><rect class="svg-output" x="178" y="40" width="44" height="30" rx="7" /><text class="svg-output-label" x="200" y="60">C</text></svg><p><b>C</b> stays blocked while A is active or present.</p></article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="details-section container"><div class="detail-grid"><article><p class="eyebrow">See the blockage</p><h3>Follow the chain instead of guessing.</h3><p>Open the dependency graph when a task is locked and trace the prerequisite holding it back.</p></article><article><p class="eyebrow">Stay close to work</p><h3>A compact panel for the gaps between apps.</h3><p>Keep saGraph visible while you work in your editor, terminal, or browser.</p></article><article><p class="eyebrow">Local first</p><h3>Your task data stays on your machine.</h3><p>Use local data files and portable mode without turning the website into your task database.</p></article></div></section>

    <section class="faq-section container"><div class="section-heading"><p class="eyebrow">Questions, answered</p><h2>Small tool, clear boundaries.</h2></div><div class="faq-list"><details><summary>Does saGraph require an account?</summary><p>No. saGraph is a desktop application with local-first task data. The website is used for downloads, licensing, and release information.</p></details><details><summary>Which platforms are supported?</summary><p>Downloads are available for Windows, Linux, and macOS. Visit the download page for the current packages and architectures.</p></details><details><summary>Is saGraph a full project-management suite?</summary><p>No. It is deliberately focused on tasks, dependencies, and the next available step—not team administration or dashboards.</p></details></div></section>

    <section class="cta container card"><div><p class="eyebrow">Try one real workflow</p><h2>See what is blocking your work.</h2><p>Start with a project where one task genuinely depends on another.</p></div><a class="button button-primary" href="/download">Download saGraph <span>↗</span></a></section>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</SiteLayout>
<style>
  .hero { align-items: center; display: grid; gap: clamp(3rem, 6vw, 6rem); grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.05fr) minmax(400px, 0.95fr); min-height: 0; padding: 6rem 0; }.hero-copy { max-width: 620px; }.hero h1 { font-size: clamp(3.35rem, 4.5vw, 4.6rem); letter-spacing: -0.055em; line-height: 0.98; margin: 1.2rem 0 1.6rem; }.hero h1 span { white-space: nowrap; }.hero h1 b { color: var(--accent); font-weight: 700; }.hero-lead { color: var(--muted); font-size: clamp(0.88rem, 1vw, 0.98rem); line-height: 1.65; margin: 0; max-width: 580px; }.actions { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.75rem; margin-top: 2rem; }.button-ghost span { color: var(--accent); }.hero-meta { color: #858198; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; font-size: 0.72rem; gap: 0.65rem 1.4rem; margin-top: 1.35rem; }.hero-meta span { align-items: center; display: inline-flex; gap: 0.55rem; }.hero-meta span::before { background: #4f4a60; border-radius: 50%; content: ""; height: 4px; width: 4px; }.hero-product { min-width: 0; padding: 1.6rem 0 2.2rem; position: relative; }.hero-product::before { background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(124, 105, 255, 0.28), transparent 68%); content: ""; inset: -20%; pointer-events: none; position: absolute; }.window-card { background: #151722; border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.16); border-radius: 22px; box-shadow: 0 32px 100px rgba(60, 49, 160, 0.3); margin-left: auto; max-width: 560px; overflow: hidden; position: relative; text-align: left; transform: rotate(1.4deg); z-index: 1; }.window-top { align-items: center; background: #1c1e2b; color: #aaa7bb; display: flex; font-size: 0.7rem; justify-content: space-between; padding: 0.9rem 1rem; }.dots { display: flex; gap: 0.28rem; }.dots i { background: #706b83; border-radius: 99px; height: 6px; width: 6px; }.window-body { padding: 1.45rem; }.mini-title { color: #f4f1ff; display: flex; font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 700; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 1rem; }.mini-title span { color: #77738b; font-size: 0.7rem; font-weight: 400; }.task { align-items: center; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.07); color: #d8d5e5; display: flex; font-size: 0.8rem; gap: 0.65rem; padding: 1.1rem 0.2rem; }.task b { border-radius: 50%; color: var(--accent); font-size: 0.9rem; }.task.done { color: #77738b; text-decoration: line-through; }.task.blocked b, .task.blocked em { color: #f29aab; }.task em { color: var(--cyan); font-size: 0.68rem; font-style: normal; margin-left: auto; }.product-note { align-items: center; backdrop-filter: blur(16px); background: rgba(25, 27, 39, 0.9); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.13); border-radius: 14px; bottom: 0; box-shadow: 0 16px 50px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3); display: flex; gap: 0.8rem; padding: 0.85rem 1rem; position: absolute; right: -1rem; width: min(280px, 70%); z-index: 2; }.status-dot { background: var(--cyan); border-radius: 50%; box-shadow: 0 0 0 5px rgba(117, 216, 208, 0.1); height: 9px; flex: 0 0 auto; width: 9px; }.product-note div { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.2rem; }.product-note strong { font-size: 0.78rem; }.product-note small { color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.68rem; }
  .problem-section, .workflow-section, .logic-section, .details-section, .faq-section { padding-top: 7rem; }.section-heading { max-width: 760px; }.section-heading h2, .workflow-copy h2, .cta h2 { font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3.5rem); letter-spacing: -0.06em; line-height: 1; margin: 0.8rem 0 1.2rem; }.accent-text { color: var(--accent); }.nowrap { white-space: nowrap; }.section-intro, .workflow-copy p, .details-section p, .cta p, .logic-card p { color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.7; max-width: 650px; }
  .dependency-story { align-items: center; display: grid; column-gap: 0; grid-template-columns: auto 52px 132px 52px auto; justify-content: center; margin-top: 2.5rem; padding: 1.5rem; }.story-prerequisites { display: grid; gap: 0.7rem; position: relative; width: max-content; }.story-prerequisites::after { border-left: 1.5px solid rgba(154, 140, 255, 0.65); bottom: 25%; content: ""; position: absolute; right: 0; top: 25%; }.story-prereq-row { align-items: center; display: flex; width: 100%; }.story-prereq-line { border-top: 1.5px solid rgba(154, 140, 255, 0.65); display: block; flex: 1; min-width: 30px; }.story-task { background: var(--panel); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 14px; display: grid; gap: 0.65rem; min-width: 172px; padding: 0.9rem 1rem; position: relative; width: fit-content; }.story-task-main { align-items: center; display: flex; gap: 0.6rem; white-space: nowrap; }.story-task-main span { color: var(--cyan); font-weight: 800; }.story-task.ready { background: rgba(154, 140, 255, 0.08); border-color: rgba(154, 140, 255, 0.4); box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(92, 78, 210, 0.12); }.story-task.ready .story-task-main span { color: var(--accent); }.story-task strong { font-size: 0.86rem; }.story-task small { border: 1px solid currentColor; border-radius: 999px; color: var(--cyan); font-size: 0.62rem; font-weight: 700; justify-self: start; letter-spacing: 0.04em; padding: 0.22rem 0.5rem; text-transform: uppercase; }.story-task.ready small { color: var(--accent); }.story-connector { border-top: 1.5px solid rgba(154, 140, 255, 0.65); height: 0; position: relative; }.story-connector::after { border-bottom: 3px solid transparent; border-left: 5px solid rgba(154, 140, 255, 0.8); border-top: 3px solid transparent; content: ""; position: absolute; right: -1px; top: -4px; }.story-join { background: var(--panel-soft); border: 1px solid rgba(154, 140, 255, 0.45); border-radius: 999px; color: var(--accent); font-size: 0.62rem; font-weight: 700; justify-self: center; line-height: 1.35; padding: 0.4rem 0.65rem; text-align: center; text-transform: uppercase; width: 124px; }
  .workflow-section { align-items: center; display: grid; gap: 5rem; grid-template-columns: 0.9fr 1.1fr; }.workflow-copy h2 { max-width: 520px; }.workflow-copy > p:not(.eyebrow) { margin-bottom: 1.4rem; }.text-link { color: var(--accent); font-size: 0.9rem; font-weight: 700; }.text-link span { display: inline-block; margin-left: 0.3rem; transition: transform 0.2s ease; }.text-link:hover span { transform: translateX(4px); }.case-study { padding: 1.5rem; }.case-label { color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.72rem; margin-bottom: 0.8rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.12em; }.case-step { align-items: center; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 12px; display: flex; gap: 0.75rem; padding: 0.75rem; }.case-step > div { align-items: center; display: flex; flex: 1; gap: 0.75rem; justify-content: space-between; min-width: 0; }.case-step.ready { background: rgba(154, 140, 255, 0.09); border-color: rgba(154, 140, 255, 0.4); box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(92, 78, 210, 0.1); }.case-step.complete { background: rgba(117, 216, 208, 0.035); }.case-step.waiting { background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.015); color: var(--muted); }.case-icon { align-items: center; border: 1px solid currentColor; border-radius: 50%; color: var(--muted); display: inline-flex; flex: 0 0 auto; font-size: 0.7rem; height: 22px; justify-content: center; width: 22px; }.case-step.complete .case-icon { color: var(--cyan); }.case-step.ready .case-icon { color: var(--accent); }.case-step strong { color: var(--text); font-size: 0.88rem; }.case-step small { border: 1px solid currentColor; border-radius: 999px; color: var(--muted); flex: 0 0 auto; font-size: 0.6rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.04em; padding: 0.2rem 0.48rem; text-transform: uppercase; }.case-step.complete small { color: var(--cyan); }.case-step.ready small { color: var(--accent); }.case-line { border-left: 1.5px solid rgba(154, 140, 255, 0.38); height: 1rem; margin-left: 1.42rem; }
  .logic-grid { display: grid; gap: 1rem; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr)); margin: 2.5rem auto 0; max-width: 1120px; }.logic-card { min-width: 0; overflow: hidden; padding: 1.4rem; }.logic-title { align-items: center; display: flex; gap: 0.7rem; }.logic-title > span:last-child { color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.78rem; }.logic-symbol { border: 1px solid currentColor; border-radius: 999px; font-size: 0.68rem; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: 0.1em; padding: 0.28rem 0.55rem; }.and-symbol { color: var(--accent); }.or-symbol { color: var(--muted); }.not-symbol { color: #f87171; }.logic-svg { display: block; height: auto; margin: 1.7rem auto 1.4rem; max-width: 420px; overflow: visible; width: 100%; }.svg-task { fill: var(--panel-soft); stroke: var(--line); stroke-width: 1.5; }.danger-task { stroke: rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.6); }.svg-task-label, .svg-output-label { fill: var(--text); font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; text-anchor: middle; }.svg-output { fill: var(--accent); stroke: var(--accent); stroke-width: 1.5; }.svg-output-label { fill: #100d1d; }.svg-gate { fill: var(--panel-soft); stroke-width: 1.5; }.gate-and { stroke: var(--accent); }.gate-or { stroke: var(--muted); }.gate-not { fill: #ef4444; stroke: #ef4444; stroke-width: 1.5; }.svg-gate-label { fill: var(--accent); font-size: 9px; font-weight: 800; text-anchor: middle; }.gate-or + .svg-gate-label { fill: var(--muted); }.not-label { fill: white; }.svg-edge { fill: none; stroke-width: 1.5; }.and-edge { stroke: var(--accent); }.or-edge { stroke: var(--muted); stroke-dasharray: 6 3; }.not-edge { stroke: #ef4444; stroke-width: 2; }.logic-card p { color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.8rem; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0; }.logic-card p b { color: var(--text); }

  .details-section { padding-bottom: 1rem; }.detail-grid { border-top: 1px solid var(--line); display: grid; gap: 2rem; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); padding-top: 2rem; }.detail-grid h3 { font-size: 1rem; margin: 0.8rem 0 0.4rem; }.detail-grid p:not(.eyebrow) { font-size: 0.88rem; margin: 0; }.faq-list { border-top: 1px solid var(--line); margin-top: 2.5rem; }.faq-list details { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); padding: 1.25rem 0; }.faq-list summary { cursor: pointer; font-weight: 700; }.faq-list p { color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.7; margin: 0.8rem 2rem 0 0; max-width: 650px; }.cta { align-items: center; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-top: 6rem; padding: 2rem 2.2rem; }.cta h2 { margin-bottom: 0; max-width: 570px; }.cta p { margin: 0.8rem 0 0; max-width: 530px; }
  @media (min-width: 821px) { .problem-section .section-heading, .logic-section .section-heading { max-width: none; }.problem-section .section-intro, .logic-section .section-heading h2, .logic-section .section-intro { max-width: none; white-space: nowrap; } }
  @media (max-width: 980px) { .hero { gap: 2.5rem; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(370px, 0.9fr); }.hero h1 { font-size: clamp(3rem, 5.2vw, 3.8rem); }.workflow-section { gap: 2.5rem; grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
  @media (max-width: 820px) { .hero { grid-template-columns: 1fr; padding: 5rem 0; text-align: center; }.hero-copy { margin: 0 auto; max-width: 700px; }.hero h1 { font-size: clamp(3rem, 7.5vw, 3.8rem); }.hero-lead { margin: 0 auto; }.actions, .hero-meta { justify-content: center; }.hero-product { margin: 0 auto; max-width: 620px; width: 100%; }.window-card { margin: 0 auto; transform: none; }.product-note { right: 0; } }
  @media (max-width: 800px) { .logic-grid, .detail-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }.logic-card { margin-inline: auto; max-width: 520px; width: 100%; }.dependency-story { align-items: stretch; display: flex; flex-direction: column; }.story-prerequisites { width: 100%; }.story-connector { border-left: 1.5px solid rgba(154, 140, 255, 0.65); border-top: 0; height: 24px; margin-left: 0.8rem; width: 0; }.story-connector::after { border-bottom: 0; border-left: 3px solid transparent; border-right: 3px solid transparent; border-top: 5px solid rgba(154, 140, 255, 0.8); bottom: -1px; left: -4px; right: auto; top: auto; }.story-connector:not(.output-connector)::before { display: none; }.story-join { max-width: none; text-align: center; }.output-connector { margin-left: 50%; }.cta { align-items: flex-start; flex-direction: column; gap: 1.5rem; } }
  @media (max-width: 520px) { .hero { gap: 2.5rem; padding: 3.8rem 0 2.5rem; }.hero .eyebrow { line-height: 1.6; }.hero h1 { font-size: clamp(2.65rem, 12vw, 3.2rem); letter-spacing: -0.045em; line-height: 1; margin: 1rem 0 1.35rem; }.hero-lead { font-size: 0.86rem; line-height: 1.65; }.actions { align-items: stretch; flex-direction: column; }.actions .button { width: 100%; }.hero-meta { align-items: center; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.6rem; }.hero-product { padding: 0 0 2.5rem; }.window-body { padding: 1rem; }.task { font-size: 0.72rem; gap: 0.5rem; padding: 0.95rem 0; }.task em { font-size: 0.62rem; }.product-note { bottom: 0; left: 50%; right: auto; transform: translateX(-50%); width: min(280px, 88%); }.logic-diagram { gap: 0.35rem; }.graph-node { flex-basis: 30px; width: 30px; }.graph-merge { flex-basis: 40px; }.gate-and { width: 40px; }.graph-edge { min-width: 10px; }.logic-section .section-heading { text-align: left; }.problem-section, .workflow-section, .logic-section, .details-section, .faq-section { padding-top: 5rem; }.cta { margin-top: 5rem; padding: 1.5rem; } }
</style>
